ithin the show are easy to peg. Walker is definitely part of the Hierarchy all the way, while ghosts like Johnny Thirteen or Ember are Renegades. The Ultimate Enemy is when Danny's Shadow takes over or that possibility is at least shown to Danny of what can happen.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Randy_Cunningham:_9th_Grade_Ninja\" target=\"_blank\">Randy Cunningham</a> = Corax or Shih. If Corax (Basing on the Suit = Made out of Tengu feathers), then the Nomicon is certainly a powerful fetish book. The Sorcerer is certainly Wyrm influenced or a Nephandi that loves chaos and can easily create Fomori (And has a Rat Familiar). Willem Viceroy III is a rogue Progenitor that works under McFist and for McFist Industries (Which is part of Pentex).<br /> Catfish Booray is a corrupt Mokole, c'mon, Pythanthigator? Yep, Mokole.<br /> Howard is a plain old human (Kinfolk wouldn't work for that whole &quot;Don't tell anyone.&quot; warning given out) and Randy tells him what he is now (Which might be a big no-no if Corax...).<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gravity_Falls\" target=\"_blank\">Gravity Falls</a> would be sorta like Twin Peaks if done NWOD Innocents style. Don't know if Dipper would be Imbued or just a regular very young hunter/human that knows too much.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Rage CCG Collector and Artist. Visit the <a href=\"http://rageccg.proboards.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Rage CCG Forums</a>.<br /> <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.us/a/img818/5825/w20supportercliath125.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img839/9002/ylxu.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{