 long stories that are unrelated on WTFIWWY?!)<br /> Y Ruler of Time: Avenger<br /> Iron Liz: Get of Fenris<br /> MikeJ: Son of Ether or Glass Walker that breaks/tests as seen on TV products.<br /> Oancitizen: Order of Hermes, hands down.<br /> That SciFi Guy: Son of Ether, Void Engineer or Glass Walker<br /> Maven of the Eventide: Toreador<br /> <br /> I am drawing a blank on Film Brain and the Rap Critic, though.<br /> <br /> And not sure how many people played this JRPG (<a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Thousand_Arms\" target=\"_blank\">Thousand Arms</a>), but:<br /> Meis Triumph: Sidhe, House Dougal or a Satyr that's part of House Dougal.<br /> <br /> I also found the name unique enough that I have a Tux. cat named &quot;Meis&quot;. When people hear it, though, they think I named a cat &quot;Mice&quot;...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Rage CCG Collector and Artist. Visit the <a href=\"http://rageccg.proboards.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Rage CCG Forums</a>.<br /> <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.us/a/img818/5825/w20supportercliath125.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img839/9002/ylxu.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":1137,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1137-laughing-hyena","user":"Laughing Hyena","date":". 01-18-2014, 01:59 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1137-laughing-hyena","name":"Laughing Hyena","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1137_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"236"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-18T13:47:12-08:00","id":52733,"t