":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1579-camilla","name":"Camilla","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1579_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1044"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-14T20:20:29-08:00","id":72430,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Camilla</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/42557-which-creature-group-would-blank-fictional-character-would-be-in?p=72343#post72343\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Here's my attempt<br /> <br /> <b>Sailor Moon</b><br /> Either just use Senshi: The Merchandising, or here's them as vampires...</div> </div> </div> </div>You know, I've seen people propose the cast as kithain, but not this way. It's kind of weird.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <b>Inuyasha</b><br /> <br /> Inuyasha: Silver Fang Metis Ahroun<br /> Kagome: Verbena Mage<br /> Miroku: Akashic Brotherhood Mage<br /> Sango: Shih Hunter<br /> Shippo: Kitsune pup<br /> Sesshomaru: Silver Fang Philodox of high ranking<br /> Kouga: Bone Gnawer Ahroun<br /> Naraku: Either a Wyrm-tainted were-spider (forgot what they are called) or a powerful Tzimisce<br /> Kagura: Sorcerer </div> </div> </div>If you're using Silver Fangs, it would make more sense for Inu-Yasha to have less Pure Breed than his brother rather than being a metis. Setting aside that you'd have to scrap every piece of the setting that involves centuries-long lifespans for the youkai and hanyou in the cast. As for Naraku, given that he's named after the concept of hell and is made of vast numbers of spirits, a Cainite is the last thing I'd place him as, even as a remote possibility backup pick.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-14T20:57:01-08:00","id":72447,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Saur Ops Specialist</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/42557-which-creature-group-would-blank-fictional-character-would-be-in?p=72430#post72430\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> You know, I've seen people propose the cast as kithain, but not this way. It's kind of weird.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> If you're using Silver Fangs, it would make more sense for Inu-Yasha to have less Pure Breed than his brother rather than being a metis. Setting aside that you'd have to scrap every piece of the setting that involves centuries-long lifespans for the youkai and hanyou in the cast. As for Naraku, given that he's named after the concept of hell and is made of vast numbers of spirits, a Cainite is the last thing I'd place him as, even as a remote possibility backup pick.</div> </div> </div> </div>I try to avoid using Kuei-Jin as much as possible, instead preferring East Asia to be populated by Cainites (however the Kuei-Jin references for my GTA write up were too good to miss up), and I despise Demon: The Fallen, so I don't use anything from that gameline either. And I know jack about Wraith, having never played it or read the material from Wraith.<br /> <br /> That being said, you may be onto something better regarding Naraku and what supernatural he could be. So, once again, I'll rework this.<br /> <br /> However, does anybody have recommendations for what Naraku could be instead of a Tzimisce Koldun elder?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1579,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1579-camilla","user":"Camilla","date":". 02-15-2014, 12:02 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1579-camilla","name":"Camilla","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1579_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1044"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-15T07:18:38-08:00","id":72608,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Camilla</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/42557-which-creature-group-would-blank-fictional-character-would-be-in?p=72447#post72447\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I try to avoid using Kuei-Jin as much as possible, instead preferring East Asia to be populated by Cainites (however the Kuei-Jin references for my GTA write up were too good to miss up), and I despise Demon: The Fallen, so I don't use anything from that gameline either. And I know jack about Wraith, having never played it or read the material from Wraith.<br /> <br /> That being said, you may be onto something better regarding Naraku and what supernatural he could be. So, once again, I'll rework this.<br /> <br /> However, does anybody have recommendations for what Naraku could be instead of a Tzimisce Koldun elder?</div> </div> </div> </div>That's actually quite a simple thing to solve. An up-and-coming Yama King that used to be a Ferectoi.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-19T10:52:39-08:00","id":75063,"title":"","content":"<b><u>Darkstalkers/NightWarriors</u></b><br /> Jon talbain/Gallon : Fianna Ahroun or Ronin &quot; That was trained in Kailindo by StarGazers&quot;<br /> Demetri Maximoff: Venture or Lasombra<br /> Hisen-Ko: Kuei-Jin<br /> Lei-Lei: Shih<br /> B.B. Hood: Slasher/Avenger-Hunter<br /> Donovan Bane: Dhampir/Akashic Brotherhood Mage &quot;Using Spirit &amp; Prime Arcana&quot; or Shih<br /> Anita: Mortal &quot;psychic&quot; or Orphan Mage &quot; Using Mind &amp; Prime Arcana&quot;<br /> Q-Bee: Changeling <u>Seem</u>:Beast <u> Kith</u>&quot;Skitterskulk&quot; &quot;Loyalist&quot;<br /> Rikuo: Changeling <u>Seem</u>:Beast <u> Kith</u> &quot;Swimmerski&quot; Court: Freehold<br /> Felicia: Changeling <u>Seem</u>:Beast <u> Kith</u> &quot;Truefriend&quot; Court: Spring<br /> Morrgian/Lilith: Changeling <u>Seem</u>: Darkling <u> Kith</u> &quot;Leechfinger&quot; Court: Moon<br /> Bishamon: Wraith Orga:Bedlameers<br /> L.Ra