panish).<br /> ST: DtF, HtR, WtO, MtA<br /> Signature Chars: Crowley (hakalu), Joe The Nuwisha (WtA)<br /> Changelings: be afraid of the Technocracian High Five of Doom","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1754-crowley","name":"Crowley","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1754_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1639"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-03T20:20:46-07:00","id":158615,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Crowley</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/42557-which-creature-group-would-blank-fictional-character-would-be-in?p=158611#post158611\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">what would Tetsuo Shima (Akira) be?</div> </div> </div> </div>A nova from Aberrant that quickly becomes taint-buttered and develops the Universe Creation power.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-05T22:02:24-07:00","id":160571,"title":"","content":"Drakengard 3<br /> The intoners are all Fallen<br /> <b>Zero </b>A Halaku who is ether a Faustian or a Luciferan<br /> <b>One: </b>A Namaru that is ether a Faustian or a Ravener<br /> <b>Two: </b>A Asharu<br /> <b>Three: </b>A Rabisu Cryptics<br /> <b>Four: </b>A Annunaki Reconcilers<br /> <b>Five: </b>A Lammazu","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2256-goblin404","name":"Goblin404","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2256_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"71"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-12T15:04:42-07:00","id":167261,"title":"","content":"Here's an assortment of various anime characters redone as Classic World of Darkness characters.<br /> <br /> <b>Seto Kaiba</b> <i>(Yu-Gi-Oh!)</i>: Ventrue<br /> <br /> <b>Roy Mustang</b> <i>(Fullmetal Alchemist)</i>: Hermetic Mage<br /> <br /> <b>Sesshomaru </b><i>(Inuyasha)</i>: Silver Fang Ahroun<br /> <br /> <b>Itachi Uchiha </b><i>(Naruto)</i>: Assamite Antitribbu<br /> <br /> <b>Motoko Kusanagi </b><i>(Ghost in the Shell)</i>: Iteration X operative<br /> <br /> <b>Revy </b><i>(Black Lagoon): </i>Brujah<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1579,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1579-camilla","user":"Camilla","date":". 06-12-2014, 06:10 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1579-camilla","name":"Camilla","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1579_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1044"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-12T17:18:33-07:00","id":167360,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Camilla</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/42557-which-creature-group-would-blank-fictional-character-would-be-in?p=167261#post167261\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Here's an assortment of various anime characters redone as Classic World of Darkness characters.<br /> <br /> <b>Seto Kaiba</b> <i>(Yu-Gi-Oh!)</i>: Ventrue</div> </div> </div> </div>Going down that route, then for <u><b>Yu-gi-oh GX</b>:</u><br /> <b>Kenzan Tyranno: </b>Mokole, Mokol\u00e9-mbembe, Rising Sun (<i>Dino DNA...</i>)<br /> <b>Jim &quot;Crocodile&quot; Cook: </b>Mokole, Gumagan, Shrouded Sun<br /> <b>Karen: </b>Mokole Kinfolk (Crocodile)<br /> <b>Yubel: </b>Bane or Corrupted Mokole<br /> <b>Johan Andersen: </b>Children of Gaia Theruge<br /> <b>Judai Yuki: </b>Silent Strider Ragabash (<i>With a Black Spiral Dancer: Ahroun Pastlife.</i>)<br /> <b>Jun Manjoume: </b>Shadow Lord Ahroun (<i>Punishment Rite has been performed on him: Either Stone of Scorn, Satire Song, or Ostracism.</i>)<br /> <b>Edo Phoenix</b>: Silver Fang Philodox<br /> <b>Yusuke Fujiwara</b>: Black Spiral Dancer Theurge or Nephandi<br /> <b>Fubuki Tenj\u014din</b>: Shadow Lord Galliard<br /> <b>Asuka Tenjoin: </b>Black Fury, Glass Walker, or just Kinfolk<br /> <b>Ry\u014d Marufuji</b>: Shadow Lord Philodox<br /> <b>Sho Marufuji: </b>Glass Walker Philodox<br /> <b>Daichi Misawa: </b>Order of Hermes, House Bonisagus<br /> <b>Daitokuji-sensei: </b>Order of Hermes, Male, House Shaea (<i>Barrabi?</i>)<br /> <b>Pharaoh: </b>Daitokuji's Cat familiar<br /> <b>Professor Cronos de Medici:</b> Order of Hermes, House Quaesitor<br /> <b>Amon Garam: </b>Syndicate Mage (<i>Eventually becomes Barrabi in the end</i>.)<br /> <b>Austin O'Brien: </b><i>(No idea yet...)</i><br /> <b>Hayato Maeda: </b><i>(No idea yet...)</i><br /> <b>Rei Saotome: </b><i>(No idea yet...)</i><br /> <b>Camula: </b>Autarkis Vampire<br /> <b>Takuma Saiou: </b>Bane Possessed for sure, runs his own Wyrm cult.<br /> <br /> <b>Notes:</b> Yes, I'm fully aware that Silent Striders cannot take Pastlives. But that concerns their own ancestors. The tribe fits Judai because he does end up wandering around the world and never stays in one place at the end. There was even younger Silent Striders encountering ancestor spirits in Revised thanks to the Metaplot. So the idea of <i>&quot;Oh, I do have a pastlife! Oh, wait, it's a Black Spiral Dancer...&quot; </i>appeals to me.<br /> <br /> <u><b>Yu-gi-oh 5D's:</b></u><br /> <b>Crow Hogan: </b>Corax<br /> <b>Yusei Fudo: </b>Glass Walker Philodox (<i>Somewhat close to falling to the Weaver.</i>)<br /> <b>Jack Atlas</b>: Silver Fang Ahroun<br /> <b>Aki &quot;Black Rose&quot; Izayoi:</b> Black Fury Ahroun (<i>Was a Lost Cub before that</i>)<br /> <b>Luca and Lua:</b> Twins, kinfolk. Luca may have ties with changelings.<br /> <b>Bruno: </b>Weaver Drone<br /> <b>Divine:</b> Mortal with psychic numina powers.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Rage CCG Collector and Artist. Visit the <a href=\"http://rageccg.proboards.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Rage CCG Forums</a>.<br /> <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.us/a/img818/5825/w20supportercliath125.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img839/9002/ylxu.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":1137,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1137-laughing-hyena","user":"Laughing Hyena","date":". 06-13-2014, 03:46 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1137-laughing-hyena","name":"Laughing Hyena","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1137_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"236"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-13T11:06:58-07:00","id":168105,"title":"","content":"<u><b>Ginga series as Garou.</b></u><br /> <br /> <u><i>Ginga Nagareboshi Gin</i></u><br /> <b>Gin:</b> Get of Fenris Philodox (despite the name of the series translating to Silver Fang, Gin and his family are far more Get than Silver Fang in culture. Trainings from hell, battle proving worth of the man,etc.)<br /> <b>Riki:</b> Get of Fenris Ahroun or Philodox<br /> <b>Ben:</b> Silver Fang Ahroun (honourable, dignified, and a brutal fighter)<br /> <b>Cross:</b> Silent Strider Ahroun<br /> <b>John:</b> Glass Walker Ragabash<br /> <b>Akame:</b> Uktena Theurge<br /> <b>Iga-ninjas: </b>Uktena, because they are masters of many secrets.<br /> <b>Kurojyaki: </b>Wendigo Ahroun<br /> <b>Koga-ninjas:</b> Wendigo, they are secretive, very proud of their culture and will go to hell with their beliefs<br /> <b>Tiger brothers from Kai: </b>Red Talon ahroun all three. They are the most wild of the pack, with very high suspicion to anything man-made.<br /> <b>Sniper:</b> Former Glass Walker, now a BSD<br /> <b>Hyena:</b> Bone Gnawer Metis Philodox, despite being a coward in the anime, in the manga he is far more honourable and far better fighter.<br /> <b>Akakabuto:</b> Wyrm-corrupted Guralh<br /> <br /> <u><i>Ginga Densetsu WEED</i></u><br /> <b>Weed:</b> Child of Gaia Philodox, unlike his father, Weed tries to talk first and fight as his last option. He also abhors killing his foes.<br /> <b>Kyoshiro the Silver: </b>Bone Gnawer Ragabash<br /> <b>Jerome:</b> Glass Walker Ahroun metis, nearly suicidal assassin with a massive guilt complex.<br /> <b>Tesshin:</b> Wendigo Philodox<br /> <b>Hougen:</b> Black Spiral Ragabash<br /> <b>Hiro:</b> Black Fury Philodox Metis, because...well, his nickname is ball-snatcher.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://ana-mizuki.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My gallery.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/110-ana-mizuki","name":"Ana Mizuki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar110_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2484"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-13T11:55:13-07:00","id":168125,"title":"","content":"<b>@Ana Mizuki:</b> On <u><i>Ginga Denstsu Weed</i>:</u> So would <a href=\"http://ginga.wikia.com/wiki/P4\" target=\"_blank\">P4</a> be a fomori dog or wolf kinfolk?<br /> <br /> When I was in Japan some years ago, I managed to pick up issue #45 of Ginga Denstsu Weed. <a href=\"http://ginga.wikia.com/wiki/Aram\" target=\"_blank\">Aram</a> is pretty cool looking if one were to use him as a Black Spiral Dancer.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Rage CCG Collector and Artist. Visit the <a href=\"http://rageccg.proboards.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Rage CCG Forums</a>.<br /> <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.us/a/img818/5825/w20supportercliath125.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img839/9002/ylxu.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1137-laughing-hyena","name":"Laughing Hyena","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1137_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"236"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-13T12:10:40-07:00","id":168179,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Laughing Hyena</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/42557-which-creature-group-would-blank-fictional-character-would-be-in?p=168125#post168125\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><b>@Ana Mizuki:</b> On <u><i>Ginga Denstsu Weed</i>:</u> So would <a href=\"http://ginga.wikia.com/wiki/P4\" target=\"_blank\">P4</a> be a fomori dog or wolf kinfolk?<br /> <br /> When I was in Japan some years ago, I managed to pick up issue #45 of Ginga Denstsu Weed. <a href=\"http://ginga.wikia.com/wiki/Aram\" target=\"_blank\">Aram</a> is pretty cool looking if one were to use him as a Black Spiral Dancer.</div> </div> </div> </div>Neither, P4 is a Cyberdog experiment lupus gone VERY wrong. That's why Jerome is hunting him, he has to preserve his tribe's honour.<br /> <br /> As for Alam, Victor and the Russian wardogs, I think they'd be either Fenrir or Bone Gnawers. Hardly BSDs when they essentially just ran away from abusive masters to find a new home.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://ana-mizuki.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My gallery.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/110-ana-mizuki","name":"Ana Mizuki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar110_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2484"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-13T12:20:28-07:00","id":168198