"rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1044"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-20T17:16:03-07:00","id":175644,"title":"","content":"Metal Gear Solid happens to inform a lot of my oMage perception, with the Patriots and Technocracy very similar in a number of regards. The question is; what would Raiden be, in an Ascension context?<br /> <br /> (It may help to differentiate between MGS2's &quot;soldier trained in experimental VR&quot; from MGS4/MGR's &quot;cyborg ninja with super strength and almost no original body left.&quot;)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-22T14:30:46-07:00","id":177349,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ronin_Warriors\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Ronin Warriors/</b><b>Yoroiden Samurai Troopers</b>:</a><br /> (<i>The Troopers are a Hengeyokai Sentai</i>)<br /> <b>Ryo Sanada:</b> Khan (Lantern)<br /> <b>Seiji Date:</b> Kitsune Dreamweaver or Sorcerer (Mirror)<br /> <b>Shin M\u014dri:</b> Same-Bito (Pillar)<br /> <b>Xiu Li Huang:</b> Zhong Lung Mokole (Fist)<br /> <b>T\u014dma Hashiba:</b> Tengu (Leaf)<br /> <br /> <b>Byakuen</b><b> &quot;White Blaze&quot;: </b>Animal (Khan) Kinfolk<br /> <b>Jun Yamano: </b>Human (?) Kinfolk<br /> <b>Nasti Yagyu: </b>Human Kinfolk (Garou), Researcher of Myths/Folklore<br /> <b>The Ancient One: </b>Elder Stargazer or Totem Spirit/Incarna<br /> <br /> (<i>The Warlords have been tied to the Nether Realm in the Umbra for so long that they are certainly more Spirit in nature.</i>)<br /> <b>Naaza: </b>Nagah<br /> <b>Rajura: </b>Kumo<br /> <b><b>Anubis: </b></b>Corrupt/Rogue Hakken<br /> <b><b>Shutendouji</b><i>: </i></b>Hakken<br /> <b>Arago: </b>Wyrm/Centipede Incarna that rules the Nether Realm<br /> <b>Lady Kayura:</b> Tengu<br /> <br /> The armors themselves are powerful Fetishes under the &quot;Legendary&quot; category.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Rage CCG Collector and Artist. Visit the <a href=\"http://rageccg.proboards.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Rage CCG Forums</a>.<br /> <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.us/a/img818/5825/w20supportercliath125.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img839/9002/ylxu.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1137-laughing-hyena","name":"Laughing Hyena","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1137_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"236"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-23T23:56:00-07:00","id":178708,"title":"","content":"Guilty Gear<br /> <br /> <b>A.B.A: </b>Something between a Vampire and a Promethean?<br /> <br /> A.B.A is a blood-drinking Frankenstein creation. She is obsessed with keys and carries a gigantic talking key around with her.<br /> <br /> <b>Anji Mito: </b>Cult of Ecstasy or maybe a Visionary Hunter?<br /> <br /> Anji is a fan dancer, with a pair of magic fans that allow him to use wind magic. He is extremely curious.<br /> <br /> <b>Axl Low: </b>Cult of Ecstasy perhaps, given his history of slipping through time?<br /> <br /> An Axl Rose look-alike, a skinny guy in denim and a Union Jack t-shirt, he wields twin kusari-gama.<br /> <br /> <b>Baiken:</b> Assamite or maybe Brujah?<br /> <br /> One armed, very butch ronin woman with perhaps some Kunoichi tendencies...<br /> <br /> <b>Bridget: </b>Innocent Hunter, most likely with True Faith (Given her attire)<br /> <br /> MtF transgender/genderqueer nun with a magic yo-yo and teddy bear, that works as a bounty hunter. (Not kidding.)<br /> <br /> <b>Chipp Zanuff: </b>Avenger Hunter, or Akashic Brother<br /> <br /> Ninja. So fast. Whoosh.<br /> <br /> <b>Dizzy: </b>Demon, probably a slayer of the Reconciler faction<br /> <br /> An unfortunate soul with two wings, one dark that takes the form of the grim reaper, and one white that takes the form of an angel. Also she has a tail.<br /> <br /> <b>Eddie: </b>Lasombra.<br /> <br /> He fights with his shadow.<br /> <br /> <b>Faust: </b>MAR. AU. DER. Likely a former Progenitor.<br /> <br /> A doctor who wields a huge scalpel, wears a bag over his head, and engages in all kinds of &quot;cartoon&quot; attacks, like doing a breath stroke through the air...<br /> <br /> <b>I-No:</b> Verbena or maybe a Tremere<br /> <br /> A rock-n-roll witch with a talking pointy hat..<br /> <br /> <b>Jam Kuradoberi: </b>Akashic Brother<br /> <br /> Chinese bare-handed fighter<br /> <br /> <b>Johnny: </b>Orphan<br /> <br /> Pirate captain who fights with coins and a katana<br /> <br /> <b>Ky Kiske: </b>Celestial Chorus<br /> <br /> Holy Knight with Lightning powers<br /> <br /> <b>May: </b>Orphan<br /> <br /> Young girl who can wield an anchor as a weapon, and can summon sea animals to fight for her, like dolphins and whales.<br /> <br /> <b>Millia Rage: </b>Orphan, former Euthanatos<br /> <br /> Former assassin with magic hair.<br /> <br /> <b>Potemkin: </b>Progenitor<br /> <br /> Seemingly a willing slave to a russian-style government, more muscular than humanly possible with mechanical gauntlets...<br /> <br /> <b>Robo-Ky: </b>Iteration X or Sons of Ether creation<br /> <br /> A bad robotic duplicate of Ky Kiske. Has a few rather ridiculous attacks.<br /> <br /> <b>Slayer: </b>Toreador<br /> <br /> Vampire. Very fast. Likes art.<br /> <br /> <b>Sol Badguy: </b>Avenger Hunter<br /> <br /> Leading man with a flaming sword and a bad attitude.<br /> <br /> <b>Testament: </b>Verbena with a little too much jhor...<br /> <br /> Carries a scythe, lives in a grove/graveyard, uses blood-based attacks.<br /> <br /> <b>Venom: </b>Order of Hermes, perhaps...<br /> <br /> Fights with a pool cue and floating billiard balls. Has an arcane sigil dyed in his hair.<br /> <br /> <b>Zappa: </b>A Consort for A LOT of puppeteer wraiths... this guy is a walking hole in the shroud...<br /> <br /> Walks backwards and bent over backwards, like a bad marionette. Has a variety of ghosts that haunt him and attacks with them","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1078,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1078-froggy711","user":"Froggy711","date":". 06-24-2014, 03:41 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1078-froggy711","name":"Froggy711","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1078_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"314"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-24T04:49:10-07:00","id":178796,"title":"","content":"what about the Scott Pilgrim characters?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Forum's Official's Joker and Trickster. Pardon my bad english, aint my first language (I Speak Spanish).<br /> ST: DtF, HtR, WtO, MtA<br /> Signature Chars: Crowley (hakalu), Joe The Nuwisha (WtA)<br /> Changelings: be afraid of the Technocracian High Five of Doom","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1754-crowley","name":"Crowley","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1754_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1639"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-24T12:02:28-07:00","id":179113,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Froggy711</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/42557-which-creature-group-would-blank-fictional-character-would-be-in?p=178708#post178708\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Guilty Gear<br /> <b>Sol Badguy: </b>Avenger Hunter<br /> <br /> Leading man with a flaming sword and a bad attitude.</div> </div> </div> </div>Ever seen the Sol Badguy ending in the very first game for the PS1 (<i>Seeing as you left out Justice and Kliff</i>)? He's sooooo not a Hunter as defined in H:tR. At best, he probably has made an item or owns an item (<i>Limiter</i>) that makes people think he's a Hunter or mortal. If he's ever found out, I'm sure Hunters will be confused or debating over it on Hunter.Net.<br /> <br /> Plus there's the problem of figuring out what the <a href=\"http://guilty-gear.wikia.com/wiki/Gear\" target=\"_blank\">Gears</a> would fit/fall under: Demons? Fomori? A Mockery Breed? CWOD's version of Prometheans? What happens when the Sons of Ether and Progenitors get together and make something that turns around and attacks humanity as a whole?<br /> <br /> Guilty Gear's world would also make for a cWOD AU setting (<i>One that the Technocracy wouldn't like at all</i>).<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Rage CCG Collector and Artist. Visit the <a href=\"http://rageccg.proboards.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Rage CCG Forums</a>.<br /> <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.us/a/img818/5825/w20supportercliath125.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img839/9002/ylxu.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1137-laughing-hyena","name":"Laughing Hyena","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1137_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"236"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-24T15:54:23-07:00","id":179282,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Laughing Hyena</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/42557-which-creature-group-would-blank-fictional-character-would-be-in?p=179113#post179113\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Ever seen the Sol Badguy ending in the very first game for the PS1 (<i>Seeing as you left out Justice and Kliff</i>)? He's sooooo not a Hunter as defined in H:tR. At best, he probably has made an item or owns an item (<i>Limiter</i>) that makes people think he's a Hunter or mortal. If he's ever found out, I'm sure Hunters will be confused or debating over it on Hunter.Net.<br /> <br /> Plus there's the problem of figuring out what the <a href=\"http://guilty-gear.wikia.com/wiki/Gear\" target=\"_blank\">Gears</a> would fit/fall under: Demons? Fomori? A Mockery Breed? CWOD's version of Prometheans? What happens when the Sons of Ether and Progenitors get together and make something that turns around and attacks humanity as a whole?<br /> <br /> Guilty Gear's world would also make for a cWOD AU setting (<i>One that the Technocracy wouldn't like at all</i>).</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah, no idea. As convoluted as Guilty Gear's story is, I didn't really try to account for everything. Gears could be anything... Dizzy being a half-gear and Testament being a gear as well... seemed better to just ignore that part and just say &quot;these characters have magical powers, so what do these characters resemble mostly in the WOD?<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1078-froggy711","name":"Froggy711","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1078_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"314"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-25T16:14:27-07:00","id":180149,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Camilla</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/42557-which-creature-group-would-blank-fictional-character-would-be-in?p=168413#post168413\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The Third Street Saints redone as a Sabbat pack, featuring characters from all four games.<br /> <br /> <b>The Boss: </b>Tzimisce, as he (or she) is customizable in appearance<br /> <b>Johnny Gat: </b>Brujah Antitribbu<br /> <b>Shaundi: </b>Ventrue Antitribbu<br /> <b>Pierce: </b>Toreador Antitiribbu<br /> <b>Kinzie Kensington: </b>Malkavian Antitribbu<br /> <b>Matt Miller: </b>Ravnos Antitiribbu<br /> <b>Lin: </b>Gangrel Antiribbu (or Harbingers of Skulls for Zombie Lin)<br /> <b>Oleg: </b>Blood Brother<br /> <b>Viola DeWinter: </b>Lasombra<br /> <b>Carlos Mendoza: </b>Pander</div> </div> </div> </div>Unfortunately, aside from Johnny and the Boss in SR2, they aren't as violent and depraved as a Sabbat pack. I'd drop the Antitribu, and just make them all Anarchs, with Stillwater a Free State.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3200-barachiel","name":"Barachiel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3200_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"221"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-25T22:45:28-07:00","id":180454,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Froggy711</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/42557-which-creature-group-would-blank-fictional-character-would-be-in?p=178708#post178708\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><b>Axl Low: </b>Cult of Ecstasy perhaps, given his history of slipping through time?</div> </div> </div> </div>I'd say he is if mage then more of an Marauder, since he has absolutely no control of his powers, at least for now I'm not sure how things change when he becomes [redacted], he also seems to think himself as a normal dude despite everything and want's nothing more than to get back to his own time.<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Froggy711</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/42557-which-creature-group-would-blank-fictional-character-would-be-in?p=178708#post178708\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><b>Eddie: </b>Lasombra.</div> </div> </div> </div>You mean Zato-1 is a Lasombra, which would make Eddie an Abyssal entity that takes over. Zato fought using his shadow but Eddie is the shadow who nowadays merely uses Zato's corpse.<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Froggy711</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/42557-which-creature-group-would-blank-fictional-character-would-be-in?p=178708#post178708\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><b>I-No:</b> Verbena or maybe a Tremere</div> </div> </div> </div>I'd call her a Cultist of Ecstasy over either of the above, simply because she is too hedonistic and unruly to be a Tremere and is capable of Time travel on certain level.<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Froggy711</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/42557-which-creature-group-would-blank-fictional-character-would-be-in?p=178708#post178708\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><b>Sol Badguy: </b>Avenger Hunter</div> </div> </div> </div>Like said this is what he really is not. Being one of the most powerful Gears contained by his headband.<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Froggy711</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/42557-which-creature-group-would-blank-fictional-character-would-be-in?p=178708#post178708\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><b>Venom: </b>Order of Hermes, perhaps...</div> </div> </div> </div>Well... I really, really do not see any Order influence on him. If forced to stay within cWoD his a bit hard to pin down but either an Orphan who uses pool to channel his magic or for a more brutal character a Brujah using potence and celerity to hurl those billiard balls at deadly speed and accuracy, and yes in this case his pool cue would be heavily reinforced.<br /> <br /> But generally I'd still say that the Gears are basically Nova's created by <b><i>THAT MAN</i></b> while Dizzy is the first known born Nova. In fact I've used almost the whole cast as Cameo's in my long running Aberrant game. Generally they seem a better fit into Aeon Verse than into cWoD as a whole but above are the clearest disagreements I had with your assessments, leaving the Gears out since I still feel cWoD doesn't really have anything that could accurately portray them, but remember these are my opinions only. But like said I do think cWoD fares poorly in portraying them.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1629-possessed","name":"Possessed","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1629_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1140"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-26T00:28:38-07:00","id":180492,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Possessed</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/42557-which-creature-group-would-blank-fictional-character-would-be-in?p=180454#post180454\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Well... I really, really do not see any Order influence on him. If forced to stay within cWoD his a bit hard to pin down but either an Orphan who uses pool to channel his magic or for a more brutal character a Brujah using potence and celerity to hurl those billiard balls at deadly speed and accuracy, and yes in this case his pool cue would be heavily reinforced.<br /></div> </div> </div> </div>I kind of chewed on the idea of a OOH pool shark and decided I liked it. Someone who sees the game as a sort of microcosm of the universe, where with the careful application of forces one could make your will be done. The cue works as a stand in for a staff, the pool balls are crystal balls, the table is his summoning circle. And chalk is always handy... I think there is some mileage there. Maybe it doesn't work for Venom, specifically, but it was an idea.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1078-froggy711","name":"Froggy711","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1078_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"314"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-26T04:24:12-07:00","id":180667,"title":"","content":"<b>Firefly</b> (as vampires)<br /> <br /> Malcolm Reynolds: Gangrel<br /> <br /> Zoe Washburn: Brujah<br /> <br /> Hoban &quot;Wash&quot; Washburn: Malkavian<br /> <br /> Inara Sera: Toreador<br /> <br /> Jayne Cobb: Brujah<br /> <br /> Kaylee Frye: Toreador<br /> <br /> Simon Tam: Tremere<br /> <br /> River Tam: Malkavian<br /> <br /> Derrial Book: Salubri (or maybe Baali)<br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1129-sergeant-brother","name":"Sergeant Brother","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1129_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1620"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-26T04:38:26-07:00","id":180674,"title":"","content":"ok, Characters from WWE<br /> i mean Undertaker, boogeyman, Gangrel, Andre the Giant, Mankind etc...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Forum's Official's Joker and Trickster. Pardon my bad english, aint my first language (I Speak Spanish).<br /> ST: DtF, HtR, WtO, MtA<br /> Signature Chars: Crowley (hakalu), Joe The Nuwisha (WtA)<br /> Changelings: be afraid of the Technocracian High Five of Doom","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1754-crowley","name":"Crowley","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1754_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1639"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-26T11:26:27-07:00","id":181045,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Possessed</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/42557-which-creature-group-would-blank-fictional-character-would-be-in?p=180454#post180454\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'd say he is if mage then more of an Marauder, since he has absolutely no control of his powers, at least for now I'm not sure how things change when he becomes [redacted], he also seems to think himself as a normal dude despite everything and want's nothing more than to get back to his own time.</div> </div> </div> </div><b>Still on Guilty Gear:</b><br /> The 10th Memorial Book has revealed that [Redacted] is actually a Crusader from the 12th century and happens to be a natural immortal. The only thing he has to with Axel Low is that they cannot exist in the same time as each other (<i>Which has yet to be fully explained in the series</i>). My best guess is that [Refacted]'s dimensional magic comes in conflict with the random time traveling associated with Axel.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Rage CCG Collector and Artist. Visit the <a href=\"http://rageccg.proboards.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Rage CCG Forums</a>.<br /> <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.us/a/img818/5825/w20supportercliath125.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img839/9002/ylxu.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1137-laughing-hyena","name":"Laughing Hyena","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1137_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"236"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-26T19:40:09-07:00","id":181552,"title":"","content":"I've got one for you guys, might be easy or hard. The cast of the Dresden Files (The books, not that.....thing....that aired on SyFy.)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/nbylxup\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/n18segp\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0v25ewp\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/n77xu8p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1667-novagain","name":"Novagain","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"92"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-26T20:54:44-07:00","id":181605,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Laughing Hyena</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/42557-which-creature-group-would-blank-fictional-character-would-be-in?p=181045#post181045\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <b>Still on Guilty Gear:</b><br /> The 10th Memorial Book has revealed that [Redacted] is actually a Crusader from the 12th century and happens to be a natural immortal. The only thing he has to with Axel Low is that they cannot exist in the same time as each other (<i>Which has yet to be fully explained in the series</i>). My best guess is that [Refacted]'s dimensional magic comes in conflict with the random time traveling associated with Axel.</div> </div> </div> </div>Ah, thanks for this enlightened post. Very much appreciated.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1629-possessed","name":"Possessed","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1629_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1140"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-04T21:09:49-07:00","id":188474,"title":"","content":"Richard B. Riddick.<br /> <br /> ...<br /> <br /> (And associated cast.)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3407-cerushad","name":"Cerushad","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3407_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"37"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-04T23:41:03-07:00","id":188552,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Cerushad</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/42557-which-creature-group-would-blank-fictional-character-would-be-in?p=188474#post188474\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Richard B. Riddick.<br /> <br /> ...<br /> <br /> (And associated cast.)</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> <span style=\"font-family:courier new\">A rogue Void Engineer. </span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:courier new\">After killing his commanding officer for ordering him to kill a group of children that \u201cmay have become infected\u201d he stole a Void Ship and headed out into the Deep Universe. He travels the Universe in stolen Void Ships, Ethercraft, and other stranger vessels, although it isn\u2019t unknown of him to stowaway on others\u2019 ships. He wants no part of the Ascension War. When asked, he simply states, with a blade to your throat, \u201cI just wanna be left alone.\u201d</span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:courier new\">A few years ago, Riddick was spotted onboard a large Nephandi warship. Reports are sketchy, but most evidence suggests that these Nephandi hold the belief that \u201cyou keep what you kill.\u201d After defeating the ship\u2019s high priest, Riddick assumed a reluctant command. Despite his \u201clordship\u201d over this dark craft, there was a mutiny. Riddick was last seen marooned on a barren planet at the ass-end of the Universe that Union cosmographers have dubbed \u201cNot-Furya.\u201d </span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:courier new\">His Enlightened Science takes the form of \u201cstrong survival instincts\u201d and a few medical procedures. </span><br /> <br /> <b><span style=\"font-family:arial\">Eye Shine (Forces O)</span></b><br /> <span style=\"font-family:courier new\">\u201cWhere can I get eyes like that?\u201d</span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:arial\"><b>Sweet Spot (Life OOO)</b></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:courier new\">\u201cJust left of the spine, fourth lumbar down. The abdominal aorta.\u201d</span><br /> <br /> <b><span style=\"font-family:arial\">Shank (Matter OO)</span></b><br /> <span style=\"font-family:courier new\">\u201cThis is just a personal grooming appliance.\u201d</span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:8px\"><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms\">&lt;signature&gt; something witty &lt;/signature&gt;</span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/302-nazfool","name":"Nazfool","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar302_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"753"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-05T07:32:21-07:00","id":188686,"title":"","content":"Oliver Queen from Arrow.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">&quot;Steel isn't strong, boy. Flesh is stronger.&quot;</span></span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/95-fat-larry","name":"Fat Larry","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar95_2.jpeg","title":