 from that setting). but what about the rest?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Forum's Official's Joker and Trickster. Pardon my bad english, aint my first language (I Speak Spanish).<br /> ST: DtF, HtR, WtO, MtA<br /> Signature Chars: Crowley (hakalu), Joe The Nuwisha (WtA)<br /> Changelings: be afraid of the Technocracian High Five of Doom","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1754-crowley","name":"Crowley","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1754_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1639"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-09T11:46:04-07:00","id":192556,"title":"","content":"Manfred von Karma from the Phoenix Wright series would definitely be a Lasombra. One my friends says he looks like a vampire and could see him (spoiler) faking his death in part three and getting embraced. (end spoiler).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my DriveThruRPG books at: <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?author=Carrie%20Kube\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse....=Carrie%20Kube</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1834-yaoi-huntress-earth","name":"Yaoi Huntress Earth","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1834_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"535"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-27T13:30:49-07:00","id":210533,"title":"","content":"Speaking of Phoenix Wright, cWoD:<br /> <br /> <b>Wright: </b>New World Order Mage, focusing on Law-based Procedures and affecting public consciousness to be more trusting of law's ability to protect the innocent.<br /> <br /> <b>Maya Fey: </b>Dreamspeaker, consulted for her Reality Deviance allowing the contacting of the remnant consciousness of Wright's bordering on Archmaster tutor.<br /> <br /> <b>Miles Edgeworth: </b>Manfred's <i>antribu </i>childe.<br /> <br /> <b>Franziska von Karma: </b>Dhampir.<br /> <br /> <b>Godot: </b>Technocrat-turned-Kuei-jin.<br /> <br /> <b>Matt Engarde: </b>Proof that just because a Brujah is Camarilla doesn't mean they can't be an ass. Or that the clan is somehow bound to low Mental stats.<br /> <br /> <b>Dahlia Hawthorne: </b>Nephandus Verbena, turned Spectre later on.<br /> <br /> <b>Athena Cykes: </b>Daughter of Ether, with some traces of Marauder psychosis beginning to emerge.<br /> <br /> <b>Simon Blackquill: </b>Akashic Brotherhood member currently imprisoned by Iteration X for murdering one of their brightest and most well-liked minds.<br /> <br /> <b>Aura Blackquill: </b>Iteration X ambassador to the Traditions.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.us/a/img824/1346/mosz.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/180-leliel","name":"Leliel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar180_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-27T14:19:48-07:00","id":210567,"title":"","content":"Person of Interest, Mage the Ascension Style<br /> <br /> Mr. Reese is a Euthantos with deep regrets that his superiors used him for their own ends rather than to move along the great Wheel.<br /> Harold Finch is an Orphan who Awakened to a computer pargadim and created the Machine.<br /> Shaw is an Akashic Sister with a few emotional problems.<br /> Root is a Quiet-heavy Virtual Adept who's barely been pulled back from the brink of Marauder-dom.<br /> Fusco and Carter are their mortal assistants and Allies.<br /> <br /> The Bad Guys are two groups.<br /> The NWO who took possession of the Machine, and use it for &quot;good&quot; but do so in a cruel, merciless way, and care little for anyone who gets hurt.<br /> The &quot;private company&quot; who creates Samaritan in order to see rule over humanity are Iteration X.<br /> <br /> The X Factor<br /> So far, Elias is the major X-Factor, and I'd actually say he's a Ventrue Vampire who's consolidated control of the criminal underworld and sees himself as aligned with the interests of the heroes, at least in some situations. Still, no one trusts him by his very nature.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3200-barachiel","name":"Barachiel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3200_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"221"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-27T15:08:41-07:00","id":210603,"title":"","content":"Ok...Avengers from the marvel movie, Go!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Forum's Official's Joker and Trickster. Pardon my bad english, aint my first language (I Speak Spanish).<br /> ST: DtF, HtR, WtO, MtA<br /> Signature Chars: Crowley (hakalu), Joe The Nuwisha (WtA)<br /> Changelings: be afraid of the Technocracian High Five of Doom","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1754-crowley","name":"Crowley","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1754_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1639"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-27T17:28:16-07:00","id":210663,"title"