m.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1754_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1639"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-29T19:45:02-07:00","id":296395,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Crowley</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/42557-which-creature-group-would-blank-fictional-character-would-be-in?p=296346#post296346\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> what about David Bowie?</div> </div> </div> </div>Well, I believe Monstroso told OSI that the cover of the Diamond Dogs album was Bowie's true form. Perhaps Garou with mastery of shapeshifting ability. Or a chimeric spirit manifest outside the Umbra?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4123-rall-bashir","name":"Rall Bashir","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4123_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"114"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-30T06:10:03-07:00","id":297013,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Rall Bashir</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/42557-which-creature-group-would-blank-fictional-character-would-be-in?p=296395#post296395\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Well, I believe Monstroso told OSI that the cover of the Diamond Dogs album was Bowie's true form. Perhaps Garou with mastery of shapeshifting ability. Or a chimeric spirit manifest outside the Umbra?</div> </div> </div> </div>The Sovereign isn't actually Bowie, though. The creature on the cover is said to be the shapeshifter's true form, but Brock does note some details about being around the actual Bowie, and Hank mentions &quot;David Bowie looking like David Bowie from the 70s&quot;.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-30T07:37:50-07:00","id":297102,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Saur Ops Specialist</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/42557-which-creature-group-would-blank-fictional-character-would-be-in?p=297013#post297013\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> The Sovereign isn't actually Bowie, though. The creature on the cover is said to be the shapeshifter's true form, but Brock does note some details about being around the actual Bowie, and Hank mentions &quot;David Bowie looking like David Bowie from the 70s&quot;.</div> </div> </div> </div>Please stop shaming me. I consider myself one of the biggest fans. So to have gotten that wrong fills me with anguish.<br /> <br /> Now this has gotten me thinking of the whole universe in that show. In cWoD terms, it seems that the Traditionalists rule, as far as we know. You have big time Etherites, Hermetics, and Dreamspeakers. I don't really see too much of a Technocratic Union influence. You have Demons in the form of The Investors and Dr. Henry Killinger. Would many members of GCI be sufferers of Paradox backlash? Vampires exist, as do wraiths. Here comes my shame again, but I don't remember any true shifter. The abominations were all results of Superscience!<br /> <br /> OSI is definitely comprised of mortals, as was Sphinx. They had some great tech, but nothing one could call truly Enlightened, with the exception of the OSI Flying Aircraft Carrier.<br /> <br /> What would The Master be (other than 5+ ranks in Mentor)?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4123-rall-bashir","name":"Rall Bashir","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4123_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"114"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-30T12:51:52-07:00","id":297382,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Rall Bashir</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/42557-which-creature-group-would-blank-fictional-character-would-be-in?p=297102#post297102\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> What would The Master be (other than 5+ ranks in Mentor)?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Ascended Mage . xD<br /> <br /> <br /> Ok, i dont know much about the Kue Jin (other than they are allergic to wood...and lead.....)<br /> would David Lo Pan (Big Trouble in Little China) be one of them or he is Something Else? same with his Charlies Angels (i mean the three magic asian guys who work for him)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Forum's Official's Joker and Trickster. Pardon my bad english, aint my first language (I Speak Spanish).<br /> ST: DtF, HtR, WtO, MtA<br /> Signature Chars: Crowley (hakalu), Joe The Nuwisha (WtA)<br /> Changelings: be afraid of the Technocracian High Five of Doom","edited":{"userid":1754,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1754-crowley","user":"Crowley","date":". 10-30-2014, 05:58 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1754-crowley","name":"Crowley","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1754_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1639"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-30T23:25:26-07:00","id":297862,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Crowley</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/42557-which-creature-group-would-blank-fictional-character-would-be-in?p=297382#post297382\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> Ascended