ver type creation. Generally doesn't really work</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">Gunn: unimbued hunter</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">Cordelia: was a kinfolk, became awoken to True Magic, but only believes she can see visions and as such is limited by creating her own paradox (headaches)</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">Wesley: really really wanted to be a mage, but never awoke, so he's a hunter with some hedge magic</span></span></span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2197-roleplayrose","name":"roleplayrose","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2197_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"102"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-28T05:42:11-08:00","id":324423,"title":"","content":"FSN Gilgamesh would be an Archmage that collected all Wonders of First Age, and Ea/Enuma Elish is strong enough to give even Gaia a pause, at full output KILLING Gaia (it can pop up Reality Marble of his universe's Gaia, leading to Land of Steel scenario. Anti-World NP).<br /> <br /> Also Gilgamesh could chill out in Malfeus and laugh off Wyrm's corruption.<br /> <br /> There would be also Time of Judgement scenario, where Gilgamesh comes back and harnesses Wyrm to destroy those humans he sees not fitting to be ruled over. Dispose of unnecessary extras, only worthy survives.<br /> <br /> Calling Garou &quot;mongrels&quot; is obligatory.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cI am absolute, I am perfect, I am supreme. I shall be et