books)...<br /> <br /> -Jean-Claude: Toreador<br /> -Anita: She'd be the female Samuel Haight.</div> </div> </div> </div>Jean-Claude was actually &quot;borrowed&quot; for some of the classic World of Darkness short stories. In the World of Darkness, he's a Follower of Set establishing a power base in San Francisco <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4624-one-vorlon","name":"One Vorlon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4624_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"537"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-04T08:21:23-08:00","id":359129,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Camilla</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/42557-which-creature-group-would-blank-fictional-character-would-be-in?p=72447#post72447\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">. . . However, does anybody have recommendations for what Naraku could be instead of a Tzimisce Koldun elder?</div> </div> </div> </div>Naraku? From <b>Inuyasha</b>? Hmm . . .<br /> <br /> Well, Naraku starts out as Onigumo, a bandit so vile, his own men try to kill him. Badly wounded, he's taken in by a beautiful priestess who guards a powerful, but morally ambiguous, artifact. Incensed that he's too wounded to rape and kidnap her, or steal the artifact, he summons up a truckload of lesser demons and bargains with them for a new body. They devour his old body, and give him a new one (with shape shifting and poison powers). But, Onigumo is trapped in the new body, while a new mind actually controls that body - a new mind that actively dislikes Onigumo.<br /> <br /> In light of that, I'd consider Naraku a Spectre that's managed to Rise. Onigumo tried to game the system, only to have his Shadow come out on top. And now he has to watch as it subverts everything he cared about, barely able to exert enough willpower to keep it from completely killing the priestess who once cared for him.<br /> <br /> Or maybe a Bane mummy, if you want to work the whole half-demon/&quot;times without power&quot; thing going on.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4624-one-vorlon","name":"One Vorlon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4624_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"537"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-05T11:38:59-08:00","id":360380,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>One Vorlon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/42557-which-creature-group-would-blank-fictional-character-would-be-in?p=359125#post359125\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Jean-Claude was actually &quot;borrowed&quot; for some of the classic World of Darkness short stories. In the World of Darkness, he's a Follower of Set establishing a power base in San Francisco</div> </div> </div> </div>Didn't know that, thanks.<br /> <br /> What about the horror villain, Cand