le=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Classic videogame characters:<br /> <br /> Super Mario characters(Peach, Toad, Mario, etc.) - Changelings.<br /></div> </div> </div> </div>I might call Super Mario himself some kind of fera, but there aren't any were-racoons in WoD are there? He's definitely a shapeshifter.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13713-wilson","name":"Wilson","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"182"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-28T16:25:23-07:00","id":1230942,"title":"","content":"At first you might think it's odd that I'd put Jessie from the HuniePop series (<a href=\"https://huniepop.wikia.com/wiki/Jessie\" target=\"_blank\">https://huniepop.wikia.com/wiki/Jessie</a>) as a Wraith, but if you read her bio in both the original and especially part 2, you got a woman who is full of regrets, addictions, and desires to feel something in her dead-end life.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my DriveThruRPG books at: <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?author=Carrie%20Kube\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse....=Carrie%20Kube</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1834-yaoi-huntress-earth","name":"Yaoi Huntress Earth","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1834_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"535"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-09T00:48:13-07:00","id":1233361,"title":"","content":"Pennywise the Dancing Clown?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divid