-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-09T16:59:50-07:00","id":1233545,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Leliel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/42557-which-creature-group-would-blank-fictional-character-would-be-in?p=1233513#post1233513\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> How about a Persona game, any Persona game.</div> </div> </div> </div>Mages with potent Avatars?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>MtAw Homebrew:<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1051456-even-more-legacies-updated-to-2e#post1051456\" target=\"_blank\">Even more Legacies, updated to 2E</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1443819-new-2e-legacies-expanded\" target=\"_blank\">New 2E Legacies, expanded</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12619-21c-hermit","name":"21C Hermit","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12619_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3489"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-06T16:17:56-07:00","id":1243322,"title":"","content":"I always got more of a &quot;hunter&quot; vibe from persona.<br /> A group of ordinary humans given power they barely understand to combat supernatural monsters.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24313-insert-original-name","name":"[Insert Original Name]","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-13T02:33:50-07:00","id":1245371,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Crowley</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/42557-which-creature-group-would-blank-fictional-character-would-be-in?p=497085#post497085\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Pinhead and the Cenobites, as well the Lament Configuration</div> </div> </div> </div>The Lament Configurations are but pieces of a larger Reliquary, that of the Malefactor Archduke Dagon AKA Leviathan. The Cenobites could be either demon or human thralls","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23725-hardestadttheevenyounger","name":"HardestadtTheEvenYounger","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23725_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"286"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-13T19:21:03-07:00","id":1245716,"title":"","content":"With Steve Urkel, I could see him being a Son of Ether given his love of wacky science and oddball personality.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my DriveThruRPG books at: <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?author=Carrie%20Kube\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse....=Carrie%20Kube</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1834-yaoi-huntress-earth","name":"Yaoi Huntress Earth","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1834_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"535"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-29T04:55:31-07:00","id":1249667,"title":"","content":"How about the Dracula in Netflix Castelvania? <br /> <br /> Tzimisce with mastery of Protean, Thaumaturgy, and Daimonion?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2078-alucard","name":"Alucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2078_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"811"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-12T04:53:01-07:00","id":1253552,"title":"","content":"From the Conjuringverse<br /> <br /> Batsheba should be either a Spectre or a Wraith defending her fetters namely, the house.<br /> <br /> The Annabelle Demon is, obviously, a demon. Given the fact the Mullins summoned it into the doll without any sort off specialized ritual, I'm inclined to think it's a Fallen that lost its vessel and began using the doll as a reliquary.<br /> It could be of any House.<br /> <br /> Valak is, in my opinion, a bona fide Earthbound. Given its mastery of the souls of the dead, I'd be inclined to think of it as a Slayer. However, its ability to change shapes and its title &quot;Marquis of snakes&quot; makes me think it could be a Devourer who had a hand in creating those animals.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23725-hardestadttheevenyounger","name":"HardestadtTheEvenYounger","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23725_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"286"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-17T19:52:00-07:00","id":1255154,"title":"","content":"Spider-man, especially Spider-man from the PS4 game is 100% a progenitor.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">&quot;Steel isn't strong, boy. Flesh is stronger.&quot;</span></span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/95-fat-larry","name":"Fat Larry","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar95_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1337"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-04T04:06:44-07:00","id":1302512,"title":"","content":"<b><i>InuYasha</i></b><br /> <br /> Kiky\u014d<br /> Nature: Caregiver<br /> P\u2019o Nature: The Vitalist<br /> Demeanour: Fanatic<br /> Chi Balance: Balanced<br /> Direction: West<br /> Dharma: Resplendent Crane 3<br /> Physical: Strength 2, Dexterity 4, Stamina 4<br /> Social: Charisma 3, Manipulation 3, Appearance 4<br /> Mental: Perception 3, Intelligence 3, Wits 3<br /> Talents: Alertness 4, Awareness 5, Empathy 4, Expression 1, Intimidation 3, Subterfuge 2<br /> Skills: Archery 4 (Precision shots), Crafts 2 (Chi-shaping), Etiquette 1, Meditation 3, Melee 2, Performance 1, Stealth 3, Survival 2<br /> Knowledges: Academics 1, Medicine 4 (Herbalism), Occult 4, Rituals 4<br /> Disciplines: Cultivation 1, Equilibrium 4, Feng Shui 5, Internalize 1, Iron Mountain 3, Tapestry 3, Yang Prana 2, Yin Prana 2<br /> Backgrounds: Demon Jade Talisman 5 (Fragments of the <i>Shikon no Tama</i>), Nushi 5 (<i>Shinidamach\u016b</i>*)<br /> Chi Virtues: Yin 5, Yang 5<br /> Soul Virtues: Hun 5, P\u2019o 3<br /> Willpower: 10<br /> Rites: Conciliatory Doorway Ritual, Harmonious Shielding of the Guarded Home, Harmony with Night, Ritual of the Guarded Alliance, Sensing the Earth\u2019s Sickness, Construct the Dragon Bone Prison, Encircle, Restoring the Dharmic Balance<br /> Merits: Early Riser, Kami-Touched, Iron Will, Light Sleeper, Medium, True Love (InuYasha)<br /> Flaws: Enemy 5 (Naraku), Sleeping With the Enemy (InuYasha)<br /> Chi Points/Turn: 1<br /> <br /> *Allows obtaining Yin Chi with Breath or Osmosis at any Dharma level.<br /> <br /> <br /> T\u014dga (Inu no Taish\u014d)<br /> Breed: Lupus<br /> Auspice: Ahroun<br /> Beast Court Auspice: Fist<br /> Tribe: Hakken<br /> Nature: Alpha<br /> Demeanor: Idealist<br /> Rank: 5<br /> Physical: Strength 5 (7/9/8/6), Dexterity 4 (4/5/6/6), Stamina 5 (7/8/8/7)<br /> Social: Charisma 5, Manipulation 2 (0/0/0/0), Appearance 4 (3/0/4/4)<br /> Mental: Perception 4, Intelligence 5, Wits 5<br /> Talents: Alertness 4, Athletics 4, Brawl 5, Empathy 2, Intimidation 5, Leadership 4, Primal-Urge 5<br /> Skills: Crafts 1, Etiquette 3, Melee 5, Stealth 3, Survival 3<br /> Knowledges: Occult 5 (Spirits), Rituals 1<br /> Backgrounds: Fetish 18 (<i>S\u014d</i>\u2019<i>unga</i>*, <i>Tenseiga</i>**, <i>Tessaiga</i>***), Pure Breed 5<br /> Rage: 5****<br /> Gnosis: 10*****<br /> Willpower: 10<br /> Glory: 10<br /> Virtue: 9<br /> Wisdom: 10<br /> Gifts: (1) Aura of Confidence, Fair Path, Fatal Flaw, Resist Pain, Rhythm of War, Seizing the Edge, Sense Wyrm; (2) Shield of Rage, Spirit of the Fray, Storm Winds Slash, Strength of Gaia; (3) Coup de Grace, Thunder of Susano\u2019o; (4) Black Mamba Strike, Stoking Fury\u2019s Furnace, Walking the Bone Road; (5) Chaos Mechanics, Gift of the Giants, Gift of the Spriggan<br /> Rites: Rite of Binding, Rite of Talisman Dedication<br /> Merits: Battle Prowess, Born Leader, Calm Heart, Good Instincts, Impervious to Weather, Long-Distance Runner, Natural Leader, Physically Impressive, Resigned Spirit, Self-Confident, The Fire Within, True Love (Izayoi)<br /> Flaws: Impatient, Metis Child (Sessh\u014dmaru)<br /> <br /> *Gnosis 10. Attack difficulty 7, Strength +5 Aggravated damage. Activating <i>S\u014d\u2019unga</i> grants access to the Gifts: Prelude to Apocalypse, Strength Without Limit, Tornado Rider and Totem Gift (only for the Green Dragon) for the scene.<br /> **Gnosis 7. Attack difficulty 7, Strength +5 Aggravated damage to undead and spirits, no damage to living beings. Activating <i>Tenseiga </i>grants access to the Gurahl Gift: Gaia\u2019s Breath for the scene.<br /> ***Gnosis 8. Attack difficulty 7, Strength +5 Aggravated damage. Activating <i>Tessaiga </i>grants access to the Gift: Tornado Rider for the scene.<br /> *****Due to Rite of the Sacred Tattoo for the Tribal Patron, T\u014dga may spend one additional Rage per turn.<br /> ******Due to Rite of the Sacred Tattoo for the Sacred Mother, when regaining Gnosis by any means, T\u014dga regains double the normal amount.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <b><i>Avatar the Legend of Korra</i></b><br /> <br /> Korra<br /> Faction: Dreamspeakers<br /> Tribe: Ice Stalkers (Gurahl)<br /> Essence: Questing<br /> Nature: Guardian<br /> Demeanor: Crusader<br /> Physical: Strength 4, Dexterity 4, Stamina 4<br /> Social: Charisma 3, Manipulation 1, Appearance 3<br /> Mental: Perception 3, Intelligence 2, Wits 3<br /> Talents: Alertness 2, Animal Kinship 2, Athletics 4, Awareness 1, Brawl 3, Diplomacy 1, Empathy 4, Expression 2, Flying 3, Intimidation 2, Leadership 2, Subterfuge 1<br /> Skills: Acrobatics 5, Climbing 1, Drive 1, Martial Arts 4, Meditation 3, Melee 4, Riding 3, Survival 2, Swimming 2, Technology 1<br /> Knowledges: Academics 1, Cosmology 3, Cultural Savvy 3, History 1, Lore 4 (Spirits), Occult 2<br /> Backgrounds: Allies 10, Avatar 5, Cult 5, Fame 5, Influence 7, Legend 5 (Avatar), Node 10 (Republic city\u2019s spirit portal), Pure Breed 1, Status 4, Totem 2 (Raava)<br /> Arete: 7<br /> Gnosis: 3<br /> Spheres: Forces 4, Life 1, Matter 2, Prime 1, Spirit 5<br /> Honor: 5<br /> Succor: 5<br /> Wisdom: 5<br /> Gifts: Mother\u2019s Touch<br /> Willpower: 7<br /> Quintessence: 10<br /> Paradox: 0<br /> Merits: Cyclic Magick (moon cycle), Gnosis 7, Local Hero, Natural Channel, Shapechanger Kin (Gurahl), Spirit Magnet 3, True Love (Asami), Umbral Affinity<br /> Flaws: Cyclic Magick (moon cycle)<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <b><i>Love, Death and Robots [Good Hunting]</i></b><br /> <br /> Yan<br /> Attributes: Strength 3, Dexterity 4, Stamina 2, Charisma 4, Manipulation 5, Appearance 4, Perception 3, Intelligence 4, Wits 5<br /> Abilities: Academics 4, Alertness 2, Athletics 2, Awareness 3, Cosmology 3, Empathy 3, Enigmas 5, Esoterica (Occult Secrets) 5, Etiquette 2, Expression 4, Intimidation 3, Leadership 3, Martial Arts 2, Melee 3, Occult 4, Research 2, Seduction 3, Stealth 4, Subterfuge 5<br /> Willpower: 5<br /> Health Levels: OK, OK, \u20121, \u20121, \u20122, \u20123, \u20125, Incapacitated<br /> Armor Rating: 0 (two soak dice, total)<br /> Powers: Aww! (4 pts.); <i>Human Guise (4 pts.)*</i>; Human Speech; Mystic Shield (four dice, 8 pts.)<br /> <br /> *Yan lost the shapechanging abilities of a hulijing and it is locked in human form.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <b><i>Anne Rice</i>\u2019<i>s Vampire Chronicles</i></b><br /> <br /> Akasha<br /> Clan: Akashans (Toreador bloodline)<br /> Sire: Arikel<br /> Nature: Monster<br /> Demeanor: Visionary<br /> Generation: 4th<br /> Embrace: 4000 BCE<br /> Apparent Age: Early 20s<br /> Physical: Strength 9, Dexterity 9, Stamina 9<br /> Social: Charisma 7, Manipulation 5, Appearance 8<br /> Mental: Perception 5, Intelligence 4, Wits 6<br /> Talents: Acting 1, Alertness 5, Expression 2, Leadership 3, Intimidation 5, Subterfuge 4, Seduction 3, Style 3<br /> Skills: Etiquette 3 (Ancient Egyptian), Stealth 1<br /> Knowledges: Cultural Savvy 2, Esoterica 1 (Astrology), Investigation 1, Law 3 (Ancient Egyptian), Lore 5 (Vampire), Occult 3<br /> Disciplines: Auspex 9 (Clairvoyance, Telepathic Communication, Psychic Assault, False Slumber), Celerity 5, Flight 5, Fortitude 9, Obfuscate 6 (Mind Blank, Soul Mask), Potence 5, Presence 9 (Love, Vengeance of the Martyr\u2019s Legacy, Ironclad Command, Pulse of the City), Quietus 9 (Silence of Death [Vizier], Ishtar\u2019s Touch, Dagon\u2019s Call, Baal\u2019s Caress [Vizier], Taste of Bliss, Ripples of the Heart, Poison the Well of Life, Songs of Distant Vitae, Condemn the Sins of the Father), Serpentis 1, Thaumaturgy 5 (Movement of the Mind 5, Lure of Flames 5)<br /> Combination Disciplines: Burning Wrath; <i>Mark of the Heart\u2019s Blood*; </i>Quick Sight<br /> Thaumaturgical Rituals: Communicate with Kindred Sire, Communicate with Kindred Bond Mate<br /> Backgrounds: Herd 5, Status 5<br /> Virtues: Conscience 0, Self-Control 4, Courage 5<br /> Morality: Humanity 1<br /> Willpower: 10<br /> Merits: Concentration, Early Riser, Language (English; native Ancient Egyptian), Hidden Diablerie, Light Sleeper, Skin of Porcelain<br /> Flaws: Slow Healing<br /> Blood Pool/Max per Turn: 50/10<br /> <br /> <i>*</i>Combination discipline <i>(Presence 9, Quietus 9</i><i>)</i> to emulate the effect of Akasha\u2019s link through the bloodline. Any damage done to Akasha is inflicted upon all members of her bloodline as soakable damage of the same type (bashing, lethal, aggravated) that Akasha received. Furthermore, if a bloodline member commits diablerie on the holder, the diablere grants the discipline itself (without needing to fulfill the prerequisites) and lowers the diablerist generation to 4th if it was higher than that.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <b><i>Buffy